  "subject": "a woman in brand-new heels who draws a stair-free route by hand to her own birthday dinner on a hill, detours through six landmarks, and arrives by the kitchen back door where her friends are hiding the cake",
  "caption": "Cantonese 1990s Hong Kong hotel-lounge cocktail jazz-pop, relaxed mid-tempo. Vibraphone playing sparkling chord stabs and a short solo, nylon-string guitar comping jazz voicings, upright bass walking softly, brushed snare with light hi-hat, muted trumpet answering the vocal phrases. Intimate supper-club room, soft plate reverb, warm bass. Female alto, smoky but clear, relaxed phrasing with every word enunciated. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 98 BPM, F major. Breezy, wry, quietly affectionate. No electronic drums, no synth pads, no autotune, no rap, no distorted guitar, no big-band brass.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n新買嘅高踭鞋，我話唔上樓梯\n攞張白紙，畫條路，全部要平嘅\n由山腳去酒家，繞咗三條街\n彎彎曲曲，好似條蛇咁\n[Pre-Chorus]\n過咗郵筒，轉左，經過麵包舖\n每個轉彎，我都畫個記號\n[Chorus]\n繞多啲都好，總之唔上樓梯\n平平穩穩，行到你面前\n腳踭唔痛，心跳就快啲\n呢條冇級嘅路，我行得安心\n[Verse]\n遲咗廿分鐘，電話一個接一個\n我唔聽，我睇住我張地圖\n涼茶舖伯伯叫：「靚女慢慢行」\n我揮揮手，笑住繼續行\n[Pre-Chorus]\n第四個記號，係間五金舖\n第五個，係個壞咗嘅街燈\n[Chorus]\n繞多啲都好，總之唔上樓梯\n平平穩穩，行到你面前\n腳踭唔痛，心跳就快啲\n呢條冇級嘅路，我行得安心\n[Verse]\n到咗酒家，大門前面三級\n我企咗一陣，決定繞去後巷\n我由後門撞入廚房，啪一聲\n[Bridge]\n一班朋友，捧住個蛋糕，企住唔識郁\n「點解你唔由大門入？」「因為大門有級」\n[Chorus]\n繞多啲都好，我行咗成個鐘\n平平穩穩，行到你哋面前\n腳踭唔痛，蠟燭都未熄\n呢條冇級嘅路，帶我撞正你哋\n[Outro]\n平路返屋企\n慢慢行，都到",
